#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:5
msgid "Cut part"
msgstr "剪切部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech element editor allows cutting the different possible type of "
"`parts`_ to paste them later on at different place from the element editor "
"workspace."
msgstr "QElectroTech 元件编辑器允许剪切各种类型的 `部件 <parts_>`_ ，以便稍后粘贴到元件编辑器工作区中的其他位置。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:12
msgid ""
"Multiples `parts`_ can be cut at the same time, pressing ``Ctrl`` is "
"necessary to select more than one `part`_."
msgstr "可以同时剪切多个 `部件 <parts_>`_ ；要选择多个 `部件 <part_>`_ ，需要按住 ``Ctrl`` 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:16
msgid ""
"Cutting `parts`_ can be done from `menu bar`_, by right click on the `part`_"
" and from the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"可以通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_、右键点击 `部件 <part_>`_ 或相应的快捷键来剪切 `部件 <parts_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:20
msgid "Cut part from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏剪切部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:22
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:46
msgid "Select the `part`_ which should be cut."
msgstr "选择要剪切的 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:23
msgid "Select **Edit > Cut** menu item to cut the `part`_."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 剪切** 菜单项以剪切 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:28
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:31
msgid "Cut part by right click"
msgstr "通过右键剪切部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:33
msgid "Right click on the `part`_ which should be cut."
msgstr "右键点击要剪切的 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:34
msgid "Select the option **Cut** to cut the `part`_."
msgstr "选择 **剪切** 选项以剪切 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:39
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech right click PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 右键弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:42
msgid "Cut part using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用快捷键剪切部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:44
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:47
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + x`` to cut the `part`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + x`` 剪切 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/cut.rst:51
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
